# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build-context exclusions for BOTH images.
#
# Both Dockerfiles are built with the REPOSITORY ROOT as their context (see docker-compose.yml and
# docs/DOCKER.md), because the backend image needs `docker/backend/entrypoint.sh` as well as
# `backend/`. Docker only ever reads the `.dockerignore` that sits at the root of the context, so
# this one file governs both builds — there is deliberately no backend/.dockerignore or
# frontend/.dockerignore, since neither would ever be consulted and a dead ignore file is worse
# than none.
#
# The first block is the one that matters for safety, not size.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Secrets. NEVER let these into a build context ------------------------------------------
# backend/.env holds the LIVE PRODUCTION Supabase URL, the real JWT secret and the AWS media keys.
# A COPY that swept it into a layer would bake production credentials into every image, where
# `docker history` shows them and any registry push publishes them. The pattern is deliberately
# broad: it matches .env at any depth while leaving every *.example template copyable.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
infra/terraform/*.tfstate*
infra/terraform/.terraform/

# --- Version control and CI -------------------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.github

# --- Dependency and build output (reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image) -------------------------
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Not part of either image -------------------------------------------------------------------
# The Android client, the Terraform state for the real EC2 box, and the prose. Excluding docs/ is
# not cosmetic: it keeps an edit to a markdown file from invalidating the whole build cache.
android/
infra/
docs/
scripts/
*.md
*.docx

# --- Local noise ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/*.log
**/test-results
frontend/pw-screens
frontend/e2e
frontend/.vercel
.codegraph/
.agents/
.claude/
skills-lock.json
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
